--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dd46f4c48ea13f644b49af6b289fdb82, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dark cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueSequence:
  - text: The timer hits zero, $$and the screen cuts to black with the sound of ECG
      going flatline.
    displayText: The timer hits zero, and the screen cuts to black with the sound
      of ECG going flatline.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Silence.
    displayText: Silence.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: If it were a game, $$Rika would just reset and start again. $$Pause. $$Load
      a save file. $$Continue trying different choices, $$over and over, $$searching
      for the correct solution of the puzzle until she beats the odds.
    displayText: If it were a game, Rika would just reset and start again. Pause.
      Load a save file. Continue trying different choices, over and over, searching
      for the correct solution of the puzzle until she beats the odds.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: However, $$Rika's not delusional. $$She knows she cannot do that.
    displayText: However, Rika's not delusional. She knows she cannot do that.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: And she knows that saving her in this dream world would change nothing
      of the real world.
    displayText: And she knows that saving her in this dream world would change nothing
      of the real world.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The fact is, $$this is how it's turned out.
    displayText: The fact is, this is how it's turned out.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru's dead.
    displayText: Mahiru's dead.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru's been dead for a long time.
    displayText: Mahiru's been dead for a long time.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The first friend, $$and the only friend Rika's ever had, $$is dead.
    displayText: The first friend, and the only friend Rika's ever had, is dead.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Dead. $$Gone. $$Deceased. $$With her own hands.
    displayText: Dead. Gone. Deceased. With her own hands.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Departed. $$Killed. $$Murderered. $$Passed away. $$Unalived. $$Lifeless.
      $$Perished. $$Ceased to exist. $$Breathless. $$Empty. $$Forgotten.
    displayText: Departed. Killed. Murderered. Passed away. Unalived. Lifeless.
      Perished. Ceased to exist. Breathless. Empty. Forgotten.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She's dead.
    displayText: She's dead.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead.
      $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Dead. $$Deaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddead.
    displayText: Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead. Dead.
      Dead. Dead. Deaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddeaddead.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: This is how things turned out. $$And there's no redoing.
    displayText: This is how things turned out. And there's no redoing.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Mahiru's dead.
    displayText: Mahiru's dead.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '.$.$.'
    displayText: '...'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The silence keeps on going.
    displayText: The silence keeps on going.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Hgh.$.$." Rika broke it with a whimper. $$She looked up at Maya, $$staring
      at her with a slightly bitter smile.'
    displayText: '"Hgh..." Rika broke it with a whimper. She looked up at Maya, staring
      at her with a slightly bitter smile.'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Ha.$.$.haha.$.$.hahahaha.$.$.HAHAHAHAHA.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Ha...haha...hahahaha...HAHAHAHAHA..."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: She laughed hysterically. $$Her tears start to form, $$dripping down her
      face.
    displayText: She laughed hysterically. Her tears start to form, dripping down
      her face.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya, $$watching her from aside, $$looks genuinely worried.
    displayText: Maya, watching her from aside, looks genuinely worried.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"W-what? $$Rika.$.$.w-why are you laughing? $$Are you OK.$.$.?"'
    displayText: '"W-what? Rika...w-why are you laughing? Are you OK...?"'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Maya.$.$.Mahiru.$.$.Are you kidding me? $$Am I kidding myself? $$What the
      heck is this.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Maya...Mahiru...Are you kidding me? Am I kidding myself? What the
      heck is this..."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika's smile fades. $$She looks down at the void she's floating on, $$peering
      into the infinite darkness.
    displayText: Rika's smile fades. She looks down at the void she's floating on,
      peering into the infinite darkness.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“I remember it now,”'
    displayText: '“I remember it now,”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: she murmured to herself, $$turning to face Maya.
    displayText: she murmured to herself, turning to face Maya.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“You''re never real, $$are you?”'
    displayText: '“You''re never real, are you?”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Rika.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Rika..."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya reached her hand out to Rika, $$but Rika shook her hand off, $$in the
      same motion that resulted in Mahiru's death.
    displayText: Maya reached her hand out to Rika, but Rika shook her hand off, in
      the same motion that resulted in Mahiru's death.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“No matter how hard I try, $$I can''t remember how I know you.”'
    displayText: '“No matter how hard I try, I can''t remember how I know you.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“.$.$.”'
    displayText: '“...”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“There aren''t any pictures of you, $$no one except me interacts with you.”'
    displayText: '“There aren''t any pictures of you, no one except me interacts with
      you.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“.$.$.”'
    displayText: '“...”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“It makes so much sense now that you are here, $$in my dream.”'
    displayText: '“It makes so much sense now that you are here, in my dream.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“It is like in some novels, $$when the character experiences a traumatic
      event, $$they create a false memory, $$forget the real one.”'
    displayText: '“It is like in some novels, when the character experiences a traumatic
      event, they create a false memory, forget the real one.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"Rika.$.$."'
    displayText: '"Rika..."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Ignoring Maya's existence, $$Rika looked for the exit door.
    displayText: Ignoring Maya's existence, Rika looked for the exit door.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“I know I have to go and you would disappear eventually, $$but stay with
      me? $$At least until I left this room?”'
    displayText: '“I know I have to go and you would disappear eventually, but stay
      with me? At least until I left this room?”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika pleads, $$she knows it won't last, $$but she still wants some time.
      $$Maya nods to her request, $$their hands join as they walk.
    displayText: Rika pleads, she knows it won't last, but she still wants some time.
      Maya nods to her request, their hands join as they walk.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The path towards the exit of this room revealed itself decorated with rotten
      pear blossoms and shards of broken glasses. $$Rika walked along it, $$one step
      at a time, $$each step cutting into her skin deeper and deeper.
    displayText: The path towards the exit of this room revealed itself decorated
      with rotten pear blossoms and shards of broken glasses. Rika walked along it,
      one step at a time, each step cutting into her skin deeper and deeper.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya was just watching silently.
    displayText: Maya was just watching silently.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The exit isn't that far away, $$but with Rika being in this state, $$it
      might as well be miles away.
    displayText: The exit isn't that far away, but with Rika being in this state,
      it might as well be miles away.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The door is now in a few steps, $$but before she opened it, $$she stopped
      and turned around to face Maya.
    displayText: The door is now in a few steps, but before she opened it, she stopped
      and turned around to face Maya.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"I''m—"'
    displayText: '"I''m—"'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: The hug from Maya is hard enough to make her squeal and knock the air out
      of her lungs.
    displayText: The hug from Maya is hard enough to make her squeal and knock the
      air out of her lungs.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“Rika, $$I know since the first time I appeared that someday I will be
      gone.”'
    displayText: '“Rika, I know since the first time I appeared that someday I will
      be gone.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“.$.$.”'
    displayText: '“...”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '“And this decision is yours to make, $$not mine. $$You have to be the one
      to choose for yourself.”'
    displayText: '“And this decision is yours to make, not mine. You have to be the
      one to choose for yourself.”'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: '"But you know what? $$I don''t want that. $$I don''t want you to regret
      the action you made no matter how unforgivable it is. $$So, $$I won''t allow
      you to go alone."'
    displayText: '"But you know what? I don''t want that. I don''t want you to regret
      the action you made no matter how unforgivable it is. So, I won''t allow you
      to go alone."'
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f841aefe5e6e5364f8629fa39acecbdf, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika is lost for words.
    displayText: Rika is lost for words.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.04
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: bomb
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Maya's arms wrapped around Rika's waist.
